  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed ground-floor rear extension,&amp;nbsp; by reason of its size and location. results in an overly dominant extension that fails to be a subordinate to the host building. The first-floor terrace, by reason of its design, size, and location, would result in an obtrusive and incongruous form of development that would fail to be in keeping with the character and appearance of the host building and the terrace it forms part of. As such, the proposal is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach), D4 (Delivering good design) of The London Plan (2021) and policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020), and the guidance contained within Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
